  "planning_notes": [
    "Board is fixed to Arduino Uno (arduino:avr:uno). Pin mapping is preserved as provided: LDR A0, button D2, ultrasonic Trig D8/Echo D3, PWM LED D9, and D13 as a digital output/status LED.",
    "No explicit serial behavior was provided; serial_channels is left empty.",
    "Ultrasonic measurement uses HC-SR04 with timeout_us=30000us and a sample period rounded up to a control-period multiple (control_period_ms=5 => sample_period_ms=75). Validity is represented separately and held on invalid reads.",
    "Button is configured with pullup enabled and active_high=true so the model boolean is true when the (debounced/in-model) pressed state is active; no additional inversion is applied here.",
    "Energy-saving decision thresholds (ambient-dark condition and proximity condition) and the auto/forced-mode logic belong in the SysML model, not in these device requests."
  ],
